{"scene_id": "s01105", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01105.fountain", "heading": "EXT. BOMBED-OUT CINEMA - ROOFTOP - NIGHT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "LIEUTENANT FIONNUALA BRADY-ESCOBAR", "names": ["LIEUTENANT FIONNUALA BRADY-ESCOBAR", "FIONNUALA"], "gender": "f", "first": 5, "spoke": 8}, {"id": 1, "name": "SERGEANT IKENNA ABARA", "names": ["SERGEANT IKENNA ABARA", "IKENNA"], "gender": "f", "first": 7, "spoke": 4}, {"id": 2, "name": "JAMSHID TAVAKOLI", "names": ["JAMSHID TAVAKOLI", "MR. TAVAKOLI"], "gender": "m", "first": 8, "spoke": 4}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "EXT. BOMBED-OUT CINEMA - ROOFTOP - NIGHT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Half a marquee hangs by its cables.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "The facade is gone; the screen stands bare and cracked like a tooth.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Smoke drifts across a starless sky.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Below, a city of broken lamps.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "LIEUTENANT FIONNUALA BRADY-ESCOBAR, 30s, short dark hair, torn sleeve, crouches behind a ventilation stack with a scoped rifle across her knees.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "The scar on her cheek catches the glow of distant fires.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Beside her, SERGEANT IKENNA ABARA, 40s, thick-armed, bleeds slowly from a bandage on his thigh.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Further back, behind a toppled projector, huddles a civilian in a grease-stained coat: MR. JAMSHID TAVAKOLI, 60s, a projectionist, spectacles cracked.", "para": 1, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "She lifts the scope.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "He presses a hand to the bandage.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Anything?", "name": "IKENNA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Two on the street. One on the balcony opposite.", "name": "FIONNUALA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ours?", "name": "IKENNA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No.", "name": "FIONNUALA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "She doesn't move.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "The balcony light flickers.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Mr. Tavakoli shifts and a piece of masonry falls from the projector.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "She flinches.", "para": 3, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Ikenna grabs her sleeve.", "para": 3, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Easy.", "name": "IKENNA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He's making noise.", "name": "FIONNUALA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He's old.", "name": "IKENNA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He's loud.", "name": "FIONNUALA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Tavakoli raises both hands, a gesture of apology.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "She exhales.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Lowers the rifle an inch.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I show films here thirty years. I know every board in this roof.", "name": "MR. TAVAKOLI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["whispering"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then tell me which ones creak.", "name": "FIONNUALA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "All of them. Except those.", "name": "MR. TAVAKOLI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "He points to a line of beams near the edge, bare against the sky.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Can we reach them?", "name": "FIONNUALA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "If you crawl.", "name": "MR. TAVAKOLI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "She nods at Ikenna.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "He grimaces, rolls onto his stomach, begins to inch toward the beams.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Blood darkens the roof where he passes.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "She watches him go.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Then, quietly, she pulls the old man close and speaks in his ear.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "When he reaches the end, you follow. Do not stop.", "name": "FIONNUALA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And you?", "name": "MR. TAVAKOLI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I stay.", "name": "FIONNUALA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "He starts to protest.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Her eyes silence him.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "A distant shell whistles in.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "They duck.", "para": 8, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "The projectionist clings to the screen's iron frame.", "para": 8, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Ikenna reaches the beams.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Raises one hand: the signal.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Tavakoli crawls after him, gray hair dusted white with plaster.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Fionnuala rises into a crouch.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Raises the rifle.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "The balcony light flares.", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "She takes aim.", "para": 10, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Below, in the bare screen's reflection, a thousand flickers of fire wink like frames of a lost film.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}]}